{"id": "Dej0-hivwg8", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"KATANA\" to create Viral AI Videos with Claude + Higgsfield Katana. \n\nYou know those aura farming edits that are all over your feed right now.\n\nYou can now make one from a single photo of yourself.\n\nJust one photo is all it takes to start.\n\nBut how do you actually do it?\n\nSo Claude can now do motion design for you.\n\nIt works through this new Higgsfield tool called Katana.\n\nThink of it like hiring a motion designer inside your chat.\n\nFirst, you connect Higgsfield to Claude.\n\nThen you type /katana and drop in your photo.\n\nNext, you pick one of the edit styles.\n\nAnd then it just builds it.\n\nThat's the whole process.\n\nWant more than one character in your edit?\n\nYou can add up to five reference images.\n\nSo your friends, or your whole squad, can be in it.\n\nAnd what if a shot is missing?\n\nKatana will just generate it for you.\n\nSo you don't even need all the footage.\n\nYou still end up with a finished edit.\n\nNormally this kind of edit takes hours of cutting and keyframing.\n\nNow the heavy lifting happens inside Claude.\n\nAll you do is pick the look.\n\n#higgsfieldai #higgsfieldkatana #aiediting #claudecode #aivideos", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792163635, "like_count": 894, "comment_count": 444, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1783412669568042a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.694, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQODW-gKkHgR4prWyU7D7PPiJpIzHGBt-LCslo5rvZyfAeaAdKZ2aIoVvpggDEzzpGN-3ivqD7LvA55RkQr9nkTlUwFw7WoWD_3hjyE.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoAoNbZKbi0mYvGCTjGIeXl6r7mFS5NSofWx-r-O2csn1Ipu3H_k9Hoi_y0mF4Afwk&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=LOZMW6UaBakQ7kNvwHRPEDV&%3D%3D&c